      <p class="text-slate-200 text-base leading-relaxed font-medium">
        To verify Stripe webhooks in FastAPI, you must read the <strong>raw unparsed byte payload</strong> via <code>await request.body()</code> before any JSON serialization, verify it against the <code>Stripe-Signature</code> header using <code>stripe.Webhook.construct_event()</code>, and immediately return HTTP 200 within 200ms.
      </p>
    </div>

